!\MODCOMMENTS: KPS, 22 / 07 / 2015 REATIONS OF C4H7O12-4\C4H7O13-4\C4H7O23-1 FROM KUIWENS "OTHER DECOMPOSITIONS" IN C6 / C7 MECHANISM HAVE BEEN MOVED TO THE \C4_CYC_ETH PART OF THIS MECAHNISM. KUIWEN AND I NEED TO TALK ABOUT THIS
